<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Healthcare System – Verify Your Email</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      background-color: #eef3f8;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #1e2b3c;
      padding: 32px 16px;
    }
    .email-container {
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 40, 80, 0.08);
    }
    .email-header {
      padding: 36px 32px 28px 32px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e9f0f7;
    }
    .logo-mark {
      background: #1b6b8f;
      width: 48px; height: 48px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: white; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .brand-text {
      font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600;
      color: #0b2a41;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    }
    .brand-text span {
      font-weight: 400; color: #6a8aa5;
      font-size: 13px; display: block;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
    .email-content { padding: 32px; }
    .greeting {
      font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600;
      color: #0b2a41; margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .message-text {
      font-size: 15px; color: #4a647c;
      margin-bottom: 28px; line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .otp-card {
      background: #f4f9ff;
      border: 1px solid #d4e2f0;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .otp-label {
      font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.2px; font-weight: 600;
      color: #3f6b8a; margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .otp-code {
      font-size: 42px; font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 8px; color: #0e3f5e;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      background: #ffffff;
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px dashed #9ebed6;
      line-height: 1.2;
      user-select: all;
    }
    .otp-note {
      font-size: 13px; color: #5c7b95;
      margin-top: 20px;
      display: flex; justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .badge {
      background: #e1edf7;
      border-radius: 40px;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #1b6b8f;
    }
    .welcome-box {
      background: #f0faf4;
      border: 1px solid #c8e6d5;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #2e5c4a;
      line-height: 1.6;
      display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .welcome-box p { margin: 0; }
    .welcome-box strong { color: #1a5c43; }
    .security-note {
      background: #f7fafd;
      border-left: 3px solid #1b6b8f;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #4a647c;
      display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .security-note p { margin: 0; }
    .signature {
      margin-top: 28px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #4a647c;
    }
    .signature strong {
      display: block;
      color: #0b2a41;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .email-header, .email-content { padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; }
      .otp-code { font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: 5px; padding: 10px 16px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-container">
    <div class="email-header">
      <div class="logo-mark">✚</div>
      <div class="brand-text">
        Healthcare System
        <span>secure patient portal</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="email-content">
      <div class="greeting">Welcome, <%= userName %> 👋</div>
      <div class="message-text">
        Thanks for signing up with Healthcare System. To activate your account, please verify your email address using the code below.
      </div>

      <div class="otp-card">
        <div class="otp-label">Your verification code</div>
        <div class="otp-code"><%= OTP %></div>
        <div class="otp-note">
          <span>⏱️ Expires in 10 minutes</span>
          <span class="badge">One-time use</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="welcome-box">
        <span style="font-size:16px;">🎉</span>
        <p><strong>You're almost there!</strong> Enter this code in the app to finish setting up your account and access your patient portal.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="security-note">
        <span style="font-size:16px;">🔒</span>
        <p>Never share this code with anyone. Healthcare System will never ask for it via phone or email.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="signature">
        If you didn't create an account with us, you can safely ignore this email.
        <strong>— Healthcare System Team</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>